# Tournament documentation sync

Whenever you add, change, or remove tournament behavior (match formats, Official vs Fun Match rules, create/edit form fields, scoring modes, validation, lifecycle), update [`docs/tournament-guide.md`](docs/tournament-guide.md) in the same change set.

Whenever you change partner member authentication (login/signup/session/isolation), update [`docs/partner-auth.md`](docs/partner-auth.md) and the Partner white-label section in the tournament guide.

- Keep Indonesian operational explanations aligned with English UI field names.
- Update the document control **Versi konten** date at the top of the guide.
- Cover required fields (`*`), format rules (Double Stage / Elimination / Americano), and scoring (points vs race-to-games).
- Preserve the user-manual structure (Bagian A/B/C + Lampiran); do not collapse it back into an unstructured notes dump.
- Do not leave the guide stale relative to `tournamentUpsertSchema` or the Official / Fun Match wizards.
